[I] A SEGA Lindbergh Emulator for Linux

[T] This project emulates the SEGA Lindbergh, allowing games to run on modern
[T] Linux computers to be used as replacement hardware for broken Lindbergh
[T] systems in physical arcade machines.

[U] https://github.com/lindbergh-loader/lindbergh-loader

[A] Lindbergh Loader Development Team
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/emulator
[F] CROSS
[R] + x86

[L] OpenSource
[V] 2.18

[D] f996931eee6af040e8a55f599f50063e39169134320a168e70904625 lindbergh-loader-v218.tar.gz https://github.com/lindbergh-loader/lindbergh-loader/archive/v218/

var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -L$root$(pkgprefix libdir glu)
var_append GCC_WRAPPER_APPEND ' ' -I$root$(pkgprefix includedir glu)
